@startuml SEQ_08_APPROVAL_PERMOHONAN_KADEP
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-08: Menyetujui / Menolak Permohonan Pengadaan (Kadep)

actor       "Kadep"                    as Kadep
boundary    "Browser"                  as Browser
control     "InventarisController" as Controller
entity      "PermohonanAset Model"     as ModelPA
entity      "WishlistAset Model"       as ModelWA

== Lihat Permohonan Direview Kalab ==

Kadep   -> Browser     : Buka menu Permohonan Pengadaan

Browser -> Controller  : GET /inventaris/permohonan

Controller -> ModelPA  : Query permohonan status 'direview_kalab'
ModelPA --> Controller : Data permohonan
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman permohonan
Browser --> Kadep      : Daftar permohonan + tombol Setujui/Tolak

== Persetujuan Final oleh Kadep ==

Kadep   -> Browser     : Review permohonan, klik "Setujui"

Browser -> Controller  : POST /inventaris/permohonan/{id}/approve

Controller -> ModelPA  : Validasi status harus 'direview_kalab'
ModelPA --> Controller : Hasil query
Controller -> ModelPA  : update\n({status: 'disetujui', approved_by})
ModelPA --> Controller : Hasil query
Controller -> ModelWA  : update({status: 'disetujui'})
ModelWA --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> Kadep      : Status berubah menjadi 'Disetujui'

== Tolak Permohonan ==

Kadep   -> Browser     : Klik "Tolak", isi alasan penolakan

Browser -> Controller  : POST /inventaris/permohonan/{id}/reject\n{alasan_penolakan}

Controller -> ModelPA  : Validasi status harus 'direview_kalab'
ModelPA --> Controller : Hasil query
Controller -> ModelPA  : update\n({status: 'ditolak', alasan_penolakan})
ModelPA --> Controller : Hasil query
Controller -> ModelWA  : update({status: 'ditolak'})
ModelWA --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser --> Kadep      : Status berubah menjadi 'Ditolak'

@enduml